      "THURSDAYS @ 3:15-3:55PM (40 Min Class)",
      "Program Term: 1/14-5/13, 2027",
      "OFF: 4/8, 2027",
      "All Levels welcome!",
      "NOTE: Children must be enrolled in EC (Extended Class Time) with Challenger School or they will be charged the drop in fee for that day.",
      "Grades 1+*",
